<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle market steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle market steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers steady, compared to Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 64.00-67.00; 700-800 lbs 61.00-66.75; package 858 lbs 63.50. Medium and Large 2 500- 600 lbs 59.50-66.00; 700-800 lbs 64.00-64.75.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 56.25-60.00. Medium and Large 2 600-700 lbs few 50.00. Cattle and Calves Receipts - 2,000</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
